{
  "id": "e03",
  "rule": "the links of an attachment in WordPress's order (self, collection, about, author, replies, wp:featuredmedia, wp:attached-to with the parent's type and id, the edit context's actions, curies) and the embeds of its author and parent: unattached; attached to a published post, a draft, a page, a type outside REST (the API root as href), a pattern (wp_block, whose route QuarkPress does not serve), a post deleted for good (the attachment handed down, no link) and a trashed post (still linked); carol's attachment of bob's draft embedding the parent's refusal; anonymous, carol and alice; an MP3 whose cover art becomes an attachment on WordPress's side only",
  "setup": [
    {
      "option": "qp_parity_hidden_type",
      "value": "1"
    },
    {
      "post": "p:published",
      "as": "bob",
      "type": "post",
      "status": "publish",
      "title": "e03 published"
    },
    {
      "post": "p:draft",
      "as": "bob",
      "type": "post",
      "status": "draft",
      "title": "e03 draft"
    },
    {
      "post": "p:page",
      "as": "bob",
      "type": "page",
      "status": "publish",
      "title": "e03 page"
    },
    {
      "post": "p:hidden",
      "as": "bob",
      "type": "qp_hidden",
      "status": "publish",
      "title": "e03 hidden"
    },
    {
